    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d162">

                <pb facs="0164" n="158" xml:id="pg158"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Prince
                            Cantacuzene.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-28"><hi rendition="#italic">March 28,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Sir</hi>: Referring to a communication of
                    this morning, I inclose herewith for your information draft of a modus vivendi
                    which the United States are willing to enter into with the Imperial Government
                    of Russia for the, protection of fur seals on the Russian side of the Bering
                    Sea.</p>
                <p>Very truly, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d162-a1.xml" xpointer="d162-a1"/>
